
# location / building / room state labels PURGED: `location` is now `space`, and
# space / building / room are all declared as (spatial-label ...) decls in
# spatial-struct.arc, which auto-register as belief-state labels (observe + @excl
# set automatically; `space` carries (theme frequent)). Current-space reasoning is
# the spatial index; there is no location/space attr or hand-written state entry.
# The `frequent` whereabouts-habit belief moved to States.mon (it is behavioural,
# not spatial).

# env_point: nav waypoints / spawnpoints (the env_point.arc archetype). Dormant in
# hsim - GrymEngine runtime nav/spawn instantiates these.
env_point (+ obs)
    waypoint
    spawnpoint
